{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"typescript-snippets","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.0.0","displayName":"TypeScript Snippets","description":"Types, interfaces, generics, utility types and type guards.","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Snippets"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"snippets":[{"language":"TypeScript","path":"snippets/typescript.json"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"snippets/typescript.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"Interface\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"int\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"interface ${1:Name} {\",\n      \"\\t${2:field}: ${3:string};\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"An interface\"\n  },\n  \"Type alias\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"ty\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"type ${1:Name} = ${2:string};\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A type alias\"\n  },\n  \"Union type\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"un\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"type ${1:Name} = ${2:\\\"a\\\"} | ${3:\\\"b\\\"};\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A union\"\n  },\n  \"Enum\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"enum\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"enum ${1:Name} {\",\n      \"\\t${2:A} = \\\"${2:A}\\\",\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"An enum\"\n  },\n  \"Generic function\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"gfn\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"function ${1:name}<${2:T}>(${3:value}: ${2:T}): ${2:T} {\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A generic function\"\n  },\n  \"Type guard\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"guard\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"function is${1:Name}(value: unknown): value is ${1:Name} {\",\n      \"\\treturn $0;\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A type guard\"\n  },\n  \"Record\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"rec\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"Record<${1:string}, ${2:unknown}>\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"Record type\"\n  },\n  \"Partial and Pick\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"pick\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"Pick<${1:Type}, \\\"${2:field}\\\">\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"Pick fields\"\n  },\n  \"Async arrow with types\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"aat\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"const ${1:name} = async (${2:arg}: ${3:string}): Promise<${4:void}> => {\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"};\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A typed async function\"\n  },\n  \"Zod schema\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"zod\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"const ${1:Schema} = z.object({\",\n      \"\\t${2:name}: z.string(),\",\n      \"});\",\n      \"type ${1:Schema}Type = z.infer<typeof ${1:Schema}>;\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A Zod object schema\"\n  },\n  \"Class with constructor\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"cls\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"class ${1:Name} {\",\n      \"\\tconstructor(private readonly ${2:dep}: ${3:Dep}) {}\",\n      \"\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A class\"\n  }\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# TypeScript Snippets\n\nTypes, interfaces, generics, utility types and type guards.\n\nType a prefix and press Tab. 11 snippets.\n\n| Language | Prefix | What it inserts |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| TypeScript | `int` | An interface |\n| TypeScript | `ty` | A type alias |\n| TypeScript | `un` | A union |\n| TypeScript | `enum` | An enum |\n| TypeScript | `gfn` | A generic function |\n| TypeScript | `guard` | A type guard |\n| TypeScript | `rec` | Record type |\n| TypeScript | `pick` | Pick fields |\n| TypeScript | `aat` | A typed async function |\n| TypeScript | `zod` | A Zod object schema |\n| TypeScript | `cls` | A class |\n\nThis extension runs no code and asks for no permissions.\n"}}}